  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nature Based Adaptation towards Prosperous and Adept Lives &amp; Livelihoods in Bangladesh (NABAPALLAB)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased climate resilience for vulnerable communities, as well as environmental protection and restoration in the southern part of Bangladesh. Practical Action will ensure resilient and environmentally friendly livelihood practises in the selected geographical area (Satkhira, Khulna, and Bagerhat districts).</narrative>
